{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他已经往前迈过一步，不甘心退回原地，却仍拿不准方向，越逼自己定下来越恼火。\",\n      \"key\": \"拿不准方向\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时没再追问自己为何非得那么用力，顺着轻松歇了口气，又盼着那种不用防备、能自在亲近的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"自在亲近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"text\": \"眼下离那样的日子还远，轻松留不住，当初没想清就先动的决定又冒出来，他也疑心刚才那股劲是不是真心。\",\n      \"key\": \"决定又冒出来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R11\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他已经行动、不甘心退回原地的意愿，删去投入自然带来快乐、因不再畏缩而高兴的解释。它重复R8且珠子支撑不足；改用逼自己定下方向却始终无法安定，解释B1的恼火与B3的内心纠缠。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R12\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留短暂轻松的真实感、暂时不再追问自己的用力缘由，以及对自在亲近生活的向往。删去缺少前史依据的道德意味，把抽象的顺着自由改成他顺势歇口气，让轻松不只是逃开难题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R13\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留轻松退去、旧决定重现和怀疑刚才是否真心的转折。用向往的日子仍离眼下很远，说明这份轻松为什么无法持续，也保留S04重新确认原决定作用的前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7dfdb99d-3762-4650-996d-5045ee04b481", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223806824853Z", "elapsed_seconds": 474.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:46:01.712690+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5996b9e0cb10627b8bc3428b5b09e3e40089c93345f254e9f7ee09b029a6cbba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223806824853Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b500d894c22071ff92dfc0ad2603480bfeaaf05b4f7a505dc85b70e5526db38d"}}}
